   </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>High ambient heat leads to <b>frequent compressor overheating</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Unserviced units cause <b>excessive noise</b> and vibration.</li>\n                        <li>Low refrigerant levels result in <b>low cooling efficiency</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Using non-genuine parts leads to <b>repeated system failure</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Clogged filters reduce <b>indoor air quality</b> drastically.</li>\n                        <li>Untreated water leaks cause <b>damage to interior walls</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Neglected maintenance results in <b>heavy electricity bills</b>.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Godhra Product Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4 text-blue-900\">Which Types of Products We Repair</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-12\">Complete cooling maintenance for residential and industrial sectors in Godhra &#038; Halol.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Window-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Window AC Repair Godhra\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/window-ac-service-godhra\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Window AC Service</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Deep <b>window ac repair</b> including high-pressure cleaning and motor work.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/window-ac-servi