   </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Godhra Local Areas -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-blue-900 text-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase text-yellow-400\">Areas We Serve in Godhra &#038; Panchmahal</h2>\n            <div class=\"mb-12\">\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 border-b border-blue-700 pb-2\">Residential &#038; Town Areas</h3>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4 text-sm text-blue-200\">\n                    <span>Bamroli Road</span> <span>Vavdi Buzurg</span> <span>Civil Lines</span> <span>Polan Bazar</span> <span>Sherpura</span> <span>Prabha Kunj</span>\n                    <span>Sardar Nagar</span> <span>Vraj Dham</span> <span>Godhra Town</span> <span>Halol Town</span> <span>Kalol Town</span> <span>Shehera</span>\n                    <span>Morva Hadaf</span> <span>Ghoghamba</span> <span>Jambughoda</span> <span>Vejalpur</span> <span>Kanjari</span> <span>Samsherpura</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 border-b border-blue-700 pb-2\">Industrial Belts</h3>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-sm text-blue-200\">\n                    <span>Halol GIDC</span> <span>Kalol GIDC</span> <span>Panchmahal Industrial Estate</span> <span>Godhra GIDC Area</span>\n                    <span>Jambughoda Industrial</span> <span>Shehera Industrial Area</span> <span>Vejalpur Industrial</span> <span>Morva Highway Units</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Godhra FAQs -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase text-blue-900\">Godhra Service FAQs</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What is the cost of split AC service in Godhra?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Our basic <b>ac jet service</b> in Godhra starts from ₹599. We provide comprehensive cleaning to remove fine semi-urban dust from your unit.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you provide AC repair in Halol and Kalol GIDC?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we have a dedicated team for <b>industrial ac repair</b> serving all factories and offices in Halol and Kalol GIDC.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Can you fix central HVAC for industrial plants?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Absolutely. <b>Atlas Aircon</b> provides specialized <b>chiller repair services</b> and heavy-duty hvac maintenance for large manufacturing units in Panchmahal.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What brands of AC do you repair in Godhra?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We offer <b>multi-brand ac repair</b> for all leading brands including LG, Samsung, Daikin, Voltas, Blue Star, and Hitachi.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Is gas charging available for all AC types?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we provide <b>ac gas charging</b> for split, window, and commercial units using certified refrigerants like R32, R410, and R22.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you offer repair for inverter PCB circuits in Godhra?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Our technicians are experts in <b>inverter pcb repair</b>, ensuring your advanced cooling system is restored without a full board replacement.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How long does a standard AC service take?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">A professional <b>ac jet wash service</b> usually takes between 45 to 90 minutes per unit in Godhra.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">Do you use original copper pipes for repairs?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Yes, we strictly use high-grade <b>genuine copper pipe for ac</b> to ensure maximum heat exchange and leak protection.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">What is the warranty on Godhra repairs?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">We provide a standard <b>service warranty</b> on labor and a separate duration warranty on various <b>ac spare parts</b> replaced.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-sm border-l-4 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h5 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2 text-orange-700\">How can I book an Atlas Aircon technician?</h5>\n                    <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Booking is fast. Click the <b>WhatsApp button</b> on our banner or call our Godhra service desk at <b>+91 97272 57141</b>.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-blue-900 text-white py-12 border-t-4 border-yellow-400\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-12\">\n            <div>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/03/cropped-AtlasAircon-Logo.png\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon Godhra\" class=\"h-12 mb-6\" title=\"\">\n                <p class=\"text-yellow-100\">Professional <b>AC repair Godhra</b> and industrial cooling experts. Reliable service across the Panchmahal district.</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-yellow-400\">Godhra Helpline</h4>\n                <p class=\"mb-2\">Call: +91 97272 57141</p>\n                <p>Location: Godhra/Halol, Gujarat</p>\n            </div>\n            <div>\n                <h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-yellow-400\">Quick Links</h4>\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 text-sm text-yellow-100\">\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-godhra\" class=\"hover:underline\">AC Repair</a>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-vadodara\" class=\"hover:underline\">Vadodara</a>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-service-godhra\" class=\"hover:underline\">AC Service</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"border-t border-blue-800 mt-12 pt-8 text-center text-blue-200 text-sm italic\">\n            &copy; 2024 Atlas Aircon. Dedicated AC Service in Godhra &#038; Panchmahal.\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n</div>",
